[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C01_REPORT_FUEL_SILO]
Operation <=Greenlight=> Plan B Report: Fire Safety Expert Group

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C01_REPORT_FUEL_SILO_DESC]
Ponyville’s fuel silo needs regular maintenance and fire safety checks, which provides our agents with an excellent infiltration opportunity. We can station a fire safety expert group in Ponyville, and all “experts” in this group are an agents of our Ministry of Order!

